# LF line ends in every checkout (also Windows with core.autocrlf): the generated parts of the docs are compared with
# the code byte for byte by npm test / CI, and the TV and the setup program expect LF files.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
*.wgt binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
